<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοπάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aim at, guess, divine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γὰρ τοπάζειν τοῦ σαφ᾽ εἰδέναι δίχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1369
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ δὲ δόξῃ τοπάζω, ταῦτ᾽ ἰδεῖν
					σαφῶς θέλω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					235
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοπάζετε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					73
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					155d
				</span></i>
			: folld. by a relat. clause, ib.<i><span class="en">
				151b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε . . , εἴτε μὴ</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				159a
			</span></i>: folld. by acc. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				489d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				228d
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝέον τι γίνεσθαι ἐτοπάσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					78.25
				</span></i>
			. (The literal sense <i>to put in a place,</i> given by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, is not found in classical Gr.)</div>
